<section class="hobbies" id="hobbies">
    <h2 class="hobbies-heading">Hobbies</h2>

    <div class="hobbies-list">
        <article class="hobby-card">
            <h3 class="hobby-card__title">Self-Taught Musician</h3>
            <div class="hobby-card__row">
                <p class="hobby-card__text">
                    Wrote and recorded music at home for my band Gemini Sun, with a few songs
                    released on streaming platforms. Played bass and sang in the live band,
                    rehearsing regularly and playing shows.
                </p>
                <ul class="hobby-card__links">
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://open.spotify.com/track/1b3PgdiycxCRhtB03r5XCK" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            <img src="img/spotify.svg" alt="Spotify"/>
                            <span>Spotify</span>
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=0LfLr6vu90Y" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            <img src="img/youtube-music.svg" alt="YouTube Music"/>
                            <span>YouTube Music</span>
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="hobby-card">
            <h3 class="hobby-card__title">Competitive Gamer</h3>
            <h4 class="hobby-card__subtitle">Marvel Rivals</h4>
            <div class="hobby-card__row">
                <p class="hobby-card__text">
                    I play Marvel Rivals ranked and spend a fair bit of time learning map
                    layouts and character match-ups. Peak placement so far is Diamond, and
                    I'm aiming for Grandmaster. I enjoy playing tank, and my two mains are
                    Captain America and Deadpool.
                </p>
                <ul class="hobby-card__mains">
                    <li class="hobby-card__main">
                        <img src="img/project/marvelrivals-cap.png" alt="Captain America"
                             @onclick='() => _lightbox.Open("img/project/marvelrivals-cap.png", "Captain America")'/>
                        <span>Captain America</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="hobby-card__main">
                        <img src="img/project/marvelrivals-deadpool.png" alt="Deadpool"
                             @onclick='() => _lightbox.Open("img/project/marvelrivals-deadpool.png", "Deadpool")'/>
                        <span>Deadpool</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h4 class="hobby-card__subtitle">Deadlock</h4>
            <div class="hobby-card__row">
                <p class="hobby-card__text">
                    Deadlock is a game I've started playing recently, but it's really got its
                    hooks in me. It has an incredible art style and all of the heroes are very
                    unique. My two mains so far are Apollo and Mina, but I'm slowly learning
                    all the different heroes they have available.
                </p>
                <ul class="hobby-card__mains">
                    <li class="hobby-card__main">
                        <img src="img/project/deadlock-apollo.png" alt="Apollo"
                             @onclick='() => _lightbox.Open("img/project/deadlock-apollo.png", "Apollo")'/>
                        <span>Apollo</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="hobby-card__main">
                        <img src="img/project/deadlock_mina.png" alt="Mina"
                             @onclick='() => _lightbox.Open("img/project/deadlock_mina.png", "Mina")'/>
                        <span>Mina</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="hobby-card">
            <div class="hobby-card__row">
                <div class="hobby-card__row-content">
                    <h3 class="hobby-card__title">Retro Game Collector</h3>
                    <p class="hobby-card__text">
                        Mostly PS2 and Nintendo DS titles. I enjoy the nostalgia, and how these
                        older games make you take a step back and slow down. The current
                        highlight of the collection is Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <img src="img/project/smt-devilsurvivor.jpg" alt="Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor box art" class="hobby-card__cover"
                     @onclick='() => _lightbox.Open("img/project/smt-devilsurvivor.jpg", "Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor")'/>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="hobby-card">
            <h3 class="hobby-card__title">Regular Gym-Goer</h3>
            <p class="hobby-card__text">
                Got into fitness through CrossFit, drawn to the community of pushing through
                tough workouts together, and now mostly train with barbell and dumbbell
                exercises.
            </p>
            <p class="hobby-card__aside">
                (No links or pictures here, you'll just have to trust me)
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<ImageLightbox @ref="_lightbox"/>

@code {
    private ImageLightbox _lightbox = null!;
}
